        "id": "topic-3",
        "step_content": {
          "type": "information",
          "title": "Данни за сравнение",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{font:18px/1.65 Arial,sans-serif;color:#202936;margin:0;padding:12px;max-width:920px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}p{margin:12px 0}strong{color:#17385e}figure{margin:16px 0;padding:12px;background:#f2f6fb;border-radius:10px}img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto}figcaption,.source{font-size:14px;color:#53677b}li{margin:8px 0}.example,.note,.task{background:#edf5fc;border-left:4px solid #3682ad;padding:12px}h3{font-size:20px}a{color:#155a95}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:580px;font-size:15px}th,td{border:1px solid #cbd8e6;padding:8px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{background:#edf4fb}pre{white-space:pre-wrap}caption{text-align:left;font-weight:bold}*{box-sizing:border-box}</style></head><body><main><figure><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martin-lift/Edu108/main/missions/ready/12_class/problem-solving-with-ict/38-it-investment-tco-calculator/images/topic-3.svg\" alt=\"Основни връзки: Данни за сравнение\" width=\"840\" height=\"430\"><figcaption>Основни връзки: Данни за сравнение</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Параметър</th><th>A</th><th>B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Покупка на комплект, у.е.</td><td>1500</td><td>1700</td></tr><tr><td>Еднократен лиценз, у.е.</td><td>100</td><td>0, включен в покупката</td></tr><tr><td>Поддръжка за година, у.е.</td><td>80</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Средна мощност при работа, W</td><td>90</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Часове на ден / дни годишно</td><td>6 / 200</td><td>6 / 200</td></tr><tr><td>Цена за kWh, у.е.</td><td>0,25</td><td>0,25</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</main></body></html>",
          "instruction_format": "html"
        },
        "step_rules": {
